cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this basis, please cite it as below."
title: "Qualification basis for wells and instruments above 375 °C, with an open thermoelastic benchmark"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zemani
    given-names: Toni
abstract: >-
  Duty classes 375 / 450 / 500 °C for superhot geothermal well hardware and
  downhole instruments, test methods, a machine-checkable witnessed-record
  contract, and a one-dimensional thermoelastic-plastic casing benchmark whose
  comparison with the IDDP-1 and IDDP-2 failures is published as an open
  problem.
keywords:
  - superhot geothermal
  - qualification
  - well integrity
  - thermal cycling
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tonizemani2/qualification-basis"
url: "https://zemanium.com"
